window.products.push({"id":875088,"name":"8pc Boys Flag Texas Themed Comforter Full Set, Sports Design, Colors Stands Loyalty Purity Bravery, Adults, Star Stripes Bedding, USA State Flag, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ekM7u+DIL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","description":"8pc Boys Flag Texas Themed Comforter Full Set, Sports Design, Colors Stands Loyalty Purity Bravery, Adults, Star Stripes Bedding, USA State Flag, Blue Red White Show off your Texas pride with this Texas Star Bed in a Bag Coordinated Bedding Set. With the Texas flag printed on soft microfiber fabric, this is the perfect bedding for a true cowboy. The soft and cozy microfiber comforter features a navy reverse and comes with coordinating shams, a decorative pillow and a complete sheet set. It's machine washable for easy care. We purchase items from a number of different sellers to get the best price available and sell them for enough to pay Amazon fees and clear a profit, so our price may not be the lowest price available. Product Details: Full Size Set Includes: 1 Comforter (76x90x1), 1 Fitted Sheet (54x75x12), 1 Flat Sheet (81x96x.1), 2 Standard Pillow Cases (20x30x.2), 2 Standard Shams (24x30.2), 1 Oblong Decorative Pillow Full Size Set Includes: 1 Comforter (76x90x1), 1 Fitted Sheet (54x75x12), 1 Flat Sheet (81x96x.1), 2 Standard Pillow Cases (20x30x.2), 2 Standard Shams (24x30.2), 1 Oblong Decorative Pillow 100% Polyester microfiber 100% Polyester microfiber Machine washable Machine washable Accessories Include: 8 Piece Accessories Include: 8 Piece Assembled Product Dimensions (L x W x H): 90.00\" x 76.00\" x 1.30\" Inches Assembled Product Dimensions (L x W x H): 90.00\" x 76.00\" x 1.30\" Inches","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ekM7u+DIL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OSD Black","source_asin":"B0737Z785R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-875088","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0737Z785R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0737Z785R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":875089,"name":"Kirsch Superfine Traverse Rod Set 38-66\" one-Way Draw Cord Right","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":55.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41OiCxQugxL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Kirsch Superfine Traverse Curtain Rod 38-66 Inch, White (One-Way Daw Cord Right) Telescoping Rod extends from 48 to 84 Inches Rod Strength Weight Rating: 2 lbs. of drapery per linear foot (will traverse some of the heaviest drapes on the market with ease) Condition: Brand New Constructed of Heavy .0165 Gauge steel with contour tapered profile for added strength and durability. Features ball bearing end pulleys, allowing for a lifetime of smooth operations of the heaviest draperies Rod edges are deburred and rounded for smooth traversing Laced with heavy duty braided polyester cord that is stretch and shrink resistant (#3 3/4) Includes cord tension pulley or cord drop Draw: 2 Way, Center Draw Projection from wall: 2 3/4 to 4 1/4 Inches Clearance: 2 to 3 1/2 Inches Returns: 3 1/4 to 4 3/4 Inches Includes 2 Adjustable, Reversible Master carriers and 30 traverse slides. All necessary installation hardware, brackets, screws, and detailed instructions are included Brackets can be used for ceiling mount or wall mount (inside or outside window opening)Traverse curtain rods open and close with a cord and can be split draw, one-way draw left or one-way draw right. For a stronger rod, order an adjustable rod with a minimum width close to your window size so you'll have double-strength throughout the remaining span. Or, check out our heavy-duty curtain rods. Adjustable Traversing Single Cord Draw Curtain Rods If you need your curtains to open and close with a cord, then single traverse rods are the option for you. Single traverse rods are used for operable drapes or sheers without another layer of fabric behind them. You can combine traverse rods with valance rods for a stationary layer in front of your cord draw fabric if you need to.  Traverse curtain rods are available with three different draw styles: center, sometimes called split, one-way left or one-way right. For one-way rods, the designation of left or right refers to the side of the rod where you want your drapery to stack. If you can't find a one-way draw pre-made to the size of your window, you can always use a split draw rod and convert it to one-way at home. The process is very simple and we'll be glad to talk you through it.  You'll want to hang pleated drapes or sheers on a traverse curtain rod using drapery pins. There are several styles of drapery pins made specifically for different types of curtains. Long shank or pleater pins will extend the header of your drapery upwards to conceal the traverse rod carriers and a portion of the rod while regular pins will position the top of your curtains near the eyelet on the carrier.  For large windows or heavy drapes, you might want to consider a heavy-duty curtain rod instead of a pre-made rod. This type of rod has ball-bearing carriers and extra strong components. Visit our heavy-duty curtain rod section to learn more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41OiCxQugxL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kirsch","source_asin":"B005WFGDHW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-875089","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005WFGDHW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005WFGDHW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":875090,"name":"Hampton Nautical ST-0136-wood Floor Standing Brass Harbor Master Telescope 30\"-Wood Nautical Home Decoration","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rlY7pDylL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Hampton Nautical brass telescope 30 inch with a wood handle is a true nautical gem that can serve as a functional telescope or a symbol of seafaring pride in any room or office. The stand has an adjustable knob to change and hold a specific direction.Focusing is accomplished by adjusting the eyepiece ring on the telescope tube. The scope also has a polished solid wood handle and a solid brass cap, linked by chain, to cover the lens when not in use.--The wooden tripod stand features smooth, polished round legs, each with solid brass fittings and a screw release to let you adjust the height. A solid brass chain holds the three stands together so the telescope can maintain its position","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rlY7pDylL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hampton Nautical","source_asin":"B01LYL9JXR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-875090","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LYL9JXR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LYL9JXR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
