window.products.push({"id":875093,"name":"Digital Instant Read Meat Thermometer, PureDazz Super Fast Digital Cooking Food Thermometer With Backlight LCD, Waterproof Electric Meat Thermometer L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612Tfct993L._AC_SL1044_.jpg","description":"\"Eliminate the guesswork: undercooked meat and food is a thing of the past. You don’t need to wait for an eternity to get an accurate reading. With the super-fast and accurate Smak digital meat thermometer, it takes only 2 sec. You’ll cook like a pro with this food thermometer every time Durable kitchen thermometer with quick Probe made from food grade stainless steel with an ECO friendly ABS plastic body will serve you for indoor and outdoor cooking be it meat, pastries, baking bread, deep frying, candy or drinks like tea, beer, milk, yogurt, wine. Expect more from your Instant read thermometer. Take a look at our innovative features: Water Resistant & Ease to Use We wanted the Smak food thermometer to be optimized for those who are passionate about cooking. Now with a waterproof thermometer you need minimum time to clean! Just wash with soap and running water Big Clear Backlight Screen Big (1.75”) & clear LCD display with backlight lets you see clearly while cooking in the evening, indoor or outdoors Magnetic Back This kitchen food thermometer is extremely convenient. You can store it almost anywhere and it will be always at hand. Thanks to the built-in magnet, you can store it on the refrigerator, cooker hood, magnetic knife holder or any other metal surface. Large hanging hole makes it compatible with kitchen hooks. BBQ thermometer folding design allows easy storage in kitchen drawers Auto Shut-Off Never worry about battery life! This electric meat thermometer automatically shuts off in 10 min. Calibration All Smak thermometers are pre calibrated. But for greater accuracy, you can calibrate your read thermometer Cooking Thermometer Specifications: - Water Resistance: IP65 - °F/°C Switch: Yes Package Contents: 1x Meat Thermometer (incl.CR 2032 Battery) 1x Meat Temp Chart 1x Manual\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612Tfct993L._AC_SL1044_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PureDazz","source_asin":"B07JQ267SF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-875093","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JQ267SF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JQ267SF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
