window.products.push({"id":875181,"name":"Electric Air Pump, 3000mAh Rechargeable Battery Air Mattress Pump, Portable Air Pump Mini Inflator Pump with 3 Air Nozzles, Perfect for Air Mattress B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617xhnLyz+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔【Cordless & Portable】- Unlike the traditional wired air pump, our mini air pump is only the size of a key, which can be easily put into a backpack when not in use without bringing extra burden. The latest upgraded wireless design that gets rid of tangled wires, allowing you to use it not only at home, but at the beach, camping or backcountry gatherings. ✔【Small but Powerful】- The portable air pump uses a 3000 mAh high-capacity rechargeable battery, which can work continuously for 1 hour. A fully charged air pump can continuously inflate 50 swimming rings and 30 air mattresses. With 3.5KPa air pressure and 180L/min air speed, it only takes a few seconds to a few minutes (depending on the size of the object) to complete the inflation and deflation of the object. Less waiting time, so you can enjoy playing or relaxing more easily! ✔【Super Bright LED Camping Lantern】- Our Electric air pump has 3 brightness settings. (Press the switch for 3s to turn on the light) The lowest brightness can emit soft and not harsh light, and the highest brightness can illuminate the whole tent. It's an ideal light source for night camping or hiking. In addition, it is also equipped with a hook design, you can easily hang it on the top of the tent, saving space. ✔【Safety & Anti-fall】- Air mattress pump has an overheating protection function, which can work continuously for a long time without burning, so children can use it with confidence. Ergonomic design, made of wear-resistant and anti-fall materials, non-slip, easy to hold, and comfortable to use. ✔【3 Type Nozzle for Various Inflatables】- This battery air pump comes with 3 sizes of nozzles, perfect for inflating objects such as swimming pools/floaters/toys/boats/rafts, air mattresses/beds/sofa/kayaks, yoga balls . In addition, it can also be used in vacuum storage bags to expel all the excess air from the vacuum bag, giving you great convenience and a perfect essential for outings this summer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617xhnLyz+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AP-JOUS","source_asin":"B0C4X91GR3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-875181","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4X91GR3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4X91GR3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
