window.products.push({"id":875201,"name":"PUILUO Under Sliding Cabinet Basket Organizer, 2 Tier Storage Under Cabinet Bathroom Under Sink Organizers and Storage Black Under Sink Storage for Ba","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hmzhpUV-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👍 Sliding Storage Drawers: Very compact under sink organizers and storage in two levels maximizes vertical space. The bottom sliding drawers can be pulled out by the handles for easy access to items behind the front row. There are 8 little hooks to hang stuff off the unit, effectively using the entire space of the cabinet 👍Unique Design and High Quality: Under sink organizer is made with quality ABS plastic, the double tier level is held up by thickened rods, strong and durable. The baskets with hollow design for good drainage. Easy to clean, just wipe the surface with a damp cloth 👍 Universal Dimensions: Bathroom cabinet organizer dimension is W8.5'' x D15.5'' x H12.2'', and the bottom drawer can hold bottles up to 9.1 inches high. Suitable for most under-sink cabinets, effectively using the vertical space to store cleaning supplies, making your items well organized and stored in an orderly manner 👍 Sturdy Construction: No tools required, no screws required, just do a few simple steps and you can get a strong and stable bathroom organizer under sink: Insert the four tubes into the holes of the bottom basket; Align the top and press the top basket firmly to ensure the tubes are inserted into place 👍 Multi-purpose Under Sink Storage: Perfect fit the under sinks, bathrooms, cabinets, countertops, kitchens, food pantries, offices, and other places. Can be used as bathroom toiletries storage, kitchen spice rack or office supplies shelf, etc. Modern and stylish minimalist design can be integrated into most household styles perfectly ❤ We promise: Any questions about Under Sink Organizers, our customer service will provide you with a satisfactory solution within 24 hours, please rest assured to choose PUILUO!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hmzhpUV-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PUILUO","source_asin":"B0C5DDGK3F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-875201","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5DDGK3F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5DDGK3F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
