window.products.push({"id":875490,"name":"DecorGreat Fitted Round Vinyl Dining Tablecloth, Waterproof Table Covers with Elastic and Flannel Backing, Blue Checkered Design for Small and Large T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.45,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91WrhGX+93L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It FITS. With the strong elastic at the hem, these round peva tablecloths will fit any round table perfectly. The elastic will fold all extra material underneath the table leaving a crease-free smooth cover. Choose the correct size according to the length of the table. Sizes: Size ‘Small’ will fit a table with a 40-44” diameter. Size ‘Large’ will fit a table with a 45-56” diameter. Remember to measure your table before you order. It’s WATERPROOF/SPILLPROOF. The plastic vinyl material ensures that these table covers keep your table completely dry even with many messy, oily and wet spills. Liquids (even oil) will stay on the surface. To clean, just wipe it with a damp cloth and it’s as clean as it ever was. It’s PROTECTIVE. Tables are never child- proof or party proof; it needs protection. Protect your glass or iron table from scratches, dents or breaks with these thick padded fitted table covers. The go- to- table cover when entertaining guests at home, or for arts n crafts and play time. It’s BEAUTIFUL. Take the bright floral designs for a lift-me-up type of décor or the classic gingham designs for a keep-me-classic look. Whatever design you choose to go with, it’ll definitely enhance your whole room. It’s VERSATILE. These fitted table covers are suitable to use for both indoor dining or coffee tables and outdoor patio tables. IMPORTANT: The tablecloth might look a bit creased at the edges when you receive it. The creases will disappear once the tablecloth is stretched on the table. In cases when the creases are stubborn, use a hair dryer on low heat and while blowing smooth the creases with your hand.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91WrhGX+93L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DecorGreat Inc.","source_asin":"B08ZS7PVCM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-875490","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZS7PVCM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZS7PVCM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
