window.products.push({"id":875502,"name":"Department 56 Dickens' Village Bringing Ornament Accessory","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.57,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sCo1VidFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"One Christmas evening, a group of friends set off to enjoy a dinner of celebration at a small country inn nestled in a quiet river town. As they rounded a bend in the road, they saw the small, old-fashioned village decorated for the holidays. The lights, like fairies, glowed and sparkled amid the freshly fallen snow. All evening, the conversation was full of Christmas memories and the visions the tiny town had evoked. Amidst the jovial banter and magical memories, the idea for a lighted Christmas village was born. That spark of an idea became a reality when, in 1976, Department 56 introduced a series of six hand-painted, ceramic buildings. The rest is history.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sCo1VidFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Department 56","source_asin":"B00DL9BDTY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-875502","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00DL9BDTY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00DL9BDTY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":875503,"name":"Premium Bathtub Tray Caddy - Adjustable Bamboo Bath Tub Table for 1 or 2 Person, Bathtub Caddy Tray with Extending Sides Bathtub Accessories","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61y2TaX-jEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MONEY BACK GUARANTEE. We take pride in the quality of our bathtub caddy and offer 100% MONEY BACK GUARANTEE in case it fails to live up to your expectations! Buy our bathtub reading tray, try it and if, for any reason, you think that it was not for you, we will be happy to refund every penny you paid. ✅ Plenty of Space to Hold all Bath Items. Don't limit yourself to pre made traditional tray, slots and inserts. Personalize your spa-like relaxation and arrange your items the way you like. 🔛 Adjustable to your Bathtub. This expandable bamboo bathtub caddy is perfect for bath time relaxation thanks to its adjustable design. We understand the difficulty in finding just the right bath caddy tray for tub use that’s both useful and stylish, which is why we've collaborated with talented craftsmen to create a design that is guaranteed to compliment your bathroom. Our over the tub tray adjusts from 29 to 43, allowing you to sit back and relax without the worry over measurements. 🎨 The Most Cost-effective Way to Transform your Bathroom. This bath caddy tray for bathtub use is composed of robust bamboo and lacquered to produce a waterproof bathtub organizer, bath tub table caddy that’s sure to last you for years. It’s beautifully designed to compliment your bathroom decor without the worry of humidity rotting or inflating your bath board. 💧 Water Resistant for Lasting Use. Our wooden bath tray for tub use has all of the necessary components to take you to a state of spa-like relaxation. Our bath trays for tub with book stand feature all the overlooked details that you’re sure to appreciate. Designed with you in mind, take advantage of our bathtub reading tray and catch up on your favorite tv show or recent read. 🎁 The Perfect Gift. With the holiday seasons among use, our bathtub table is just what you've been searching for. What better way to express your appreciation and love for the women in your life than with such meaningful gifts for women? Our exclusive bath rack also makes for excellent couples presents for the newlyweds in your life, as well as for celebrating an anniversary or the closing of a new house. 💰MONEY-BACK WARRANTY: Our brand, ROYAL CRAFT WOOD is committed to providing our customers the best possible support and satisfaction. That’s why we offer a comprehensive customer support program with a 1-year warranty, a money-back guarantee, and 24/7 customer support. We understand the importance of standing behind our products and ensuring our customers are delighted","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61y2TaX-jEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ROYAL CRAFT WOOD","source_asin":"B07SX1GCVD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-875503","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SX1GCVD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SX1GCVD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
