window.products.push({"id":875614,"name":"TC-JUNESUN Stick Vacuum Cleaner, 4 in 1 Lightweight Corded Vac with Handheld, 400W 15kpa Powerful Suction Small Dorm Vacuum Cleaner Portable with HEPA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YfVela1hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☀【4 In 1 Multifunctional Vacuum】Our stick vacuum cleaner is equipped with the crevice tool and square brush, 4 modes can choose from. You can quickly switch it from upright mode to handheld mode. The product package contains a total of two HEPA filters, one in the vacuum cleaner, and an extra in the package.suitable tools to clean any place you want to clean. ☀【16Kpa Powerful Suction】Our lightweight vacuum cleaner is equipped with a high-performance motor, making its suction up to 160000PA. It helps you to completely clean up all debris in a few seconds, whether it is cat litter, dog food, pet hair, snack residue paper debris etc.No safety hazard with 400w power, your indispensable cleaning assistant! ☀【Suitable for Multiple Scenarios】Our upright vacuum cleaner has ultra-lightweight, which means you can easily take it around during housework. A 5 m power cable allows you to vacuum every corner of your room, reducing the trouble of changing the plug frequently. Whether it is a sofa, curtains, hard floor, car or desktop, computer keyboard, you can easily clean! ☀【Fine Advanced Filtration System】TC-JUNESUN household vacuum cleaners with cable equipped with 0.8L Large dust tank capacity can clean all corners at once. Plus high-density HEPA removes up to 99.99% of microscopic dust particles as small as 0.1 microns. HEPA and cylinder filer are washable. Suitable for families with pets and children. 【Vacuum cleaner installation】There is an installation video of our vacuum cleaner on the page, you can refer to the installation for reference. Our vacuum cleaner has a relatively compact structure. When installing the handle, you need to insert the handle into the machine and press down firmly until the two holes are aligned (if you encounter installation problems, please communicate with us in time, we will solve it for you in time question) ☀【Warranty ＆ Customer Service】TC-JUUNESUN is a company specializing in electrical appliances manufacturing. We promise our customers that all products have a two-year warranty. Once there is any quality problem, we will provide a product renewal service or a full refund. No matter what problems you encounter during use, you can contact us at any time, we will reply to you within 24 hours！","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YfVela1hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TC-JUNESUN","source_asin":"B0B3QQZGJW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-875614","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3QQZGJW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3QQZGJW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
