window.products.push({"id":875731,"name":"NileHome Roll Up Dish Drying Rack, Sink Drying Rack Over Sink Dish Drying Rack 304 Stainless Steel Foldable Drain Rack for Kitchen Sink Counter Utensi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718DlS-9joL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KITCHEN DRAIN RACK: Over the sink drying rack，17.5(l) x 16.5(w) inch（44.5*42cm）. Suitable for most kitchen sinks and counters. Please measure your sink size before purchasing this roll-up dish drying rack over sink! MULTIPURPOSE USE: This folding stainless steel drain rack can be used to air dry cleaned pots, bowls, cups, plates, cutlery, and more; it can also be used as a water filter for vegetables and fruits, or as non-slip insulation pads for high-temperature cookware and pans. PREMIUM MATERIALS: TPE material wrapped with 304 stainless steel hard metal steel rods for durability. The dish drying rack is rust-resistant, non-slip, high-temperature resistant, more stable and durable than ordinary stainless steel drain racks. In addition, it’s environmentally friendly, non-toxic, soft-touch, and friendly to glassware. it also has oil-resistant stickers, easy to clean. EASY TO USE AND STORE: The draining rack is mainly made of 19 304 stainless steel pipes and wrapped with TPE material at both ends. The design is simple and easy to use, small size. Its biggest feature is that it can be folded and rolled up, which is more space-saving than ordinary drain racks, and one of the good partners for kitchen utensils storage. SAFETY AND ASSURANCE: TPE material has good high-temperature resistance (use temperature range50-100 ℃)and aging resistance. Our team provides a 12-month after-sales service, with no risk to purchase our products. If any questions about your dish racks, please feel free to contact us and we will give you the best solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718DlS-9joL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NileHome","source_asin":"B0BSF1TQ75","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-875731","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSF1TQ75","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSF1TQ75","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":875732,"name":"EHEYCIGA Christmas Fleece Blanket Throw Reindeer Red, Holiday Home Décor, Twin 60x80 Inches - for Bed Couch Sofa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gvjwS7bFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Decorative Pattern: The red reindeer pattern will perfectly match your wintry Christmas decoration and bring you a cozy and festive Christmas. Ultra Soft: This Christmas blanket is made of premium polyester with ultimate comfort and quality which is slippery and almost silky to touch. Let it warm you whenever and wherever you need. High Quality: Made with high grade 280 GSM fleece which is durable, wrinkle-resistant and will retains its shape very well. Its lightweight and non-shed feature make this blanket can be used both indoor and outdoor. Size: It comes with 3 different sizes, Throw 50''x65'', Twin 60''x80'', and Queen 90''x90''. Easy to care & Maintain: Simply machine wash in cold and tumble in low tempuratue. It also dry quickly which help you wash and dry at home easily.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gvjwS7bFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EHEYCIGA","source_asin":"B09BV74FFY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-875732","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BV74FFY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BV74FFY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":875733,"name":"Ginger Snaps BELLEVUE JULY SNAP SN22-43 Interchangeable Jewelry Snap Accessory","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w3fPNv7WL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Ginger Snaps BELLEVUE - JULY Fashion Snap About Ginger SnapsGinger Snaps is a whole new kind of interchangeable jewelry that features \"fashion snaps\" -- button-like charms you snap in and out of stylish bracelets, rings, and more! Ginger Snaps is all about heart and soul, sweetness and sass, and brazen individuality.�With over 200 snap designs to choose from, you can create and re-create jewelry that expresses YOUR personality, any way you choose! There's a snap for every personality, every style, and every occasion. Changing Your SnapTo change your Snaps, simply pry out using your finger. The Snap will detach from the finding and can quickly be removed and replaced with a new design.�Wear & Care of Snaps and FindingsGinger Snaps are silver plated. As with all silver-plated jewelry, tarnishing may naturally occur over time. To keep your Snaps and accessories looking their best, clean them with a dry polishing cloth. Please do not use liquid jewelry cleaners. These products strip the plating on all plated jewelry and will cause permanent damage. We also encourage you to limit exposing your Snaps and accessories to water (bathing, hand-washing, etc.) and never wear them into a pool or spa.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w3fPNv7WL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Good Bead","source_asin":"B00DXGYX4C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-875733","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00DXGYX4C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00DXGYX4C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
