window.products.push({"id":875855,"name":"LIBWYS Three Little Birds Wall Decor Rustic Home Wall decor EVERY LITTLE THING GONNA BE ALRIGHT Inspirational Wall Art, Solid Wood Carving Sign For Li","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711IKAa3x9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🪵SOLID WOOD WALL DECOR. The planks are cut from high quality Sycamore wood, retaining the fine and even texture of the original wood and are perfect for wood carving. you will get a lightweight, thick, and sturdy wall sign,which is even better in person. 🐦WOOD CARVING AND FIRING PROCESS. The words and birds are crafted by carving and keeping the original wood color, which is vividly three-dimensional from all angles. The brown color on the front and back of the wood sign is not a stain but a burning process (fire burns the original wood color into a darker color) that will maintain its grain permanently and will not crack, peel or fade. 🪵UNIQUE DESIGN WITH INSPIRATIONAL LYRICS. The bird decor is inspired by the song THREE LITTLE BIRDS, which is known for its message of peace and unity. The inspirational wall art lyrics will complete your home art wall. As a beautiful wall decor, it can be displayed in living rooms, bedrooms, kitchens, hallways, entryways and offices to convey a positive vibe. 🐦EASY TO INSTALL. No assembly required, the sawtooth hanger at the back is easy to hang and can be moved at will without leaving any trace. Lean against the wall, hang with sawtooth hangers, hang with jute twine, as you wish. Package includes 1*Three little birds wood sign, 1*Jute Twine, 2*Sawtooth Hangers, 6*Seamless nails.Size: 15\"*0.8\"*7.1\" inches. 🪵A STUNNING GIFT. The message is an encouraging song write and a nice affirmation while you‘re on a bad day. Impress your friends and family with this rustic wall decor, which can be used as a inspirational wall decor anywhere in home. It makes a thoughtful gift for father, mother, sister, brother, friends and yourself.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711IKAa3x9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIBWYS","source_asin":"B0BTH2FJQJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-875855","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTH2FJQJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTH2FJQJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":875856,"name":"Rehabilitation Advantage Hand In Mug Adaptive Drinking Cup Blue,16 ounces","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.17,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qhw-rVS+L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hand In Mug Adaptive Drinking Cup is designed to hold 16 ounces of liquid. This insulated cup maintains the temperature of your favorite beverages. Both hot and cold drinks work well with this cup. Anyone who struggles holding a cup or mug will benefit from this item. This adaptive cup features a hand slot inside of the mug for users to easily hold on to more efficiently. No longer worry about dropping and breaking your mug. Simply slide your hand inside the slot for easy handling. The 360 degree rotating lid with sliding lever secures shut to help prevent from unwanted spills. This everyday item was designed to help individuals who struggle with tremors, spasticity, and limited hand control, but can be used by people of all abilities. ⚠ WARNING: Cancer and Reproductive Harm","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qhw-rVS+L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rehabilitation Advantage","source_asin":"B08DJRR152","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-875856","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DJRR152","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DJRR152","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
